[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195624811","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109715#issuecomment-3195624811","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109715","id":3195624811,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-eV1r","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T08:20:12Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T08:20:12Z","body":"The idea itself seems to be correct, but we might want to move “fix_alpha_edges” to a shader instead.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195624811/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3198178995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109715#issuecomment-3198178995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109715","id":3198178995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-oFaz","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T19:42:24Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T19:42:24Z","body":"Yes, a shader sounds like a good fit for this. Not sure how hard...\r\n\r\nI think fix_alpha_edges could use a smaller max_radius and still be good enough for this case.\r\nI.e. add a default int max_radius = 4 param and use 1 for SVGTexture -> 9x speed improvement\r\n\r\nr = 1 -> 3x3\r\nr = 4 -> 9x9\r\n\r\nImport SVG as SVGTexture could add a “Fix Alpha Border” flag like Texture2D so you could disable when performance is more important than quality. Or even expose the radius to use “Fix Alpha Border Radius” (and disabled if r=0)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3198178995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3198739903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109715#issuecomment-3198739903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109715","id":3198739903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-qOW_","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T23:48:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T23:49:25Z","body":"Ideally, we'd be rendering GUI items with the premultiplied alpha blend mode instead, but changing the default blend mode for CanvasItemMaterial used in Control is probably too big of a change by now. We did manage to do something similar for font LCD subpixel optimizations, but you probably aren't applying shaders to them *directly*.\r\n\r\nCan't we get ThorVG to return an image that's good right out of the gate, i.e. have it perform its own premultiplied alpha?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3198739903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201820261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109715#issuecomment-3201820261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109715","id":3201820261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-1-Zl","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T18:43:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T18:43:13Z","body":"> Ideally, we'd be rendering GUI items with the premultiplied alpha blend mode instead, but changing the default blend mode for CanvasItemMaterial used in Control is probably too big of a change by now. We did manage to do something similar for font LCD subpixel optimizations, but you probably aren't applying shaders to them _directly_.\r\n> \r\n> Can't we get ThorVG to return an image that's good right out of the gate, i.e. have it perform its own premultiplied alpha?\r\n\r\nYes, thorvg can output premult alpha.\r\n\r\nProposal:\r\n\r\n1. add parameter premult_alpha=false to ImageLoaderSVG::create_image_from_utf8_buffer and friends to tell thorvg to output premult-alpha or not \r\n2. add process/premult_alpha to svg importer (default to false) - if enabled user will need to use BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA\r\n3. add process/fix_alpha_border_radius to svg importer (default 0 i.e. off); also need to add radius param to fix_alpha_edges OR add process/fix_alpha_border (default to false) - to be consistent with import as Texture2D which does not expose radius\r\n5. Add settings for premult_alpha (2) and fix_alpha_border_radius (3) to SVGTexture\r\n6. Change SVGTexture::create_from_string in order to enable fix_alpha_edges to be used for default theme icons (these are generally small, so performance impact of fix_alpha_edges should not be an issue)\r\n\r\nThoughts?\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201820261/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3282323617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109715#issuecomment-3282323617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109715","id":3282323617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DpEih","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T19:16:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T19:16:37Z","body":"From the SVGTexture -> DPITexture discussion, it's unclear to me if it's worth doing any of my proposed changes. Closing PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3282323617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]